n.hr.av-av_hr-e20845366ecf4191d9d28e96992d31d2 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-av_hr-e20845366ecf4191d9d28e96992d31d2 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-av_one_half-8cdbb378864195f7b9517e600bbf174b sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-av_one_half-8cdbb378864195f7b9517e600bbf174b av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mp2la8pz-3b63e993f9e869caa4e468112440d98d '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"2082\"><strong>Du 29 au 31 mai 2026<\/strong>, la marque <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Venol<\/span><\/span> sera pr\u00e9sente au salon international de l\u2019automobile <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Expomec\u00e2nica Porto 2026<\/span><\/span> au Portugal.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2306\">Nous invitons chaleureusement tous nos partenaires commerciaux, clients et entreprises int\u00e9ress\u00e9es par une collaboration \u00e0 nous contacter pendant l\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nement.<br data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2245\" \/>Notre \u00e9quipe sera disponible pendant toute la dur\u00e9e du salon.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2451\"><strong data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2359\">Contact pendant le salon (t\u00e9l\u00e9phone\/WhatsApp) :<\/strong><br data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2362\" \/>\ud83d\udcde +48 661 570 400 \u2013 Justyna Kacprzyk-Pietrzak<br data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2411\" \/>\ud83d\udcde +48 665 084 900 \u2013 Marta Chrustowicz<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2472\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\u00c0 bient\u00f4t \u00e0 Porto !<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-av_one_half-421c1bf5d4c122db8f22821bc87bc328 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-mp2la23z-24dd5ff4fc56f79914b9d9722839935a\">\n.avia-image-container.av-mp2la23z-24dd5ff4fc56f79914b9d9722839935a img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-mp2la23z-24dd5ff4fc56f79914b9d9722839935a .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-mp2la23z-24dd5ff4fc56f79914b9d9722839935a av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-5  avia-builder-el-no-sibling '   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image-5382 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-5382 avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-4-1030x1030.png\" alt='' title='porto-venol'  height=\"1030\" width=\"1030\"  itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" srcset=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-4-1030x1030.png 1030w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-4-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-4-80x80.png 80w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-4-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-4-1536x1536.png 1536w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploa